  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One year extension of the Volunteering for Development (V4D) programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity One year extension of the Volunteering for Development (V4D) programme is a component of Volunteering For Development  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;9,000,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Reproductive health care, Environmental policy and administrative management, Disaster prevention and preparedness, Primary education, Teacher training, Democratic participation and civil society, Food assistance, Research/scientific institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
